{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nock your arrow and challenge your friends in archery golf!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master realistic arrow physics and challenge your friends for a round in beautiful and challenging 9 target courses. Gain a competitive edge with skillful usage of different arrows, avoid obstacles and utilize shortcuts. The player with the least amount of shots wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570010/extras/BowCourse_ChallengeFriends.gif?t=1744872209\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or challenge your friends in multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic bow handling &amp; arrow physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Versatile courses - Each 9 target course offers several routes and shortcuts that players can tactically use with different arrows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun and challenging gameplay \u2014 Easy to pick up but offers depth to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Practice at the shooting range in the main hub area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable difficulty - choose starting point, wind conditions &amp; more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play comfortably with teleport, smooth locomotion and other settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570010/extras/FunGameplay_600x250_25fps.gif?t=1744872209\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570010?t=1744872209","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570010?t=1744872209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570010/a90113d2c0d8fa282f4fcfc2994f3f8eeb7a2139/capsule_231x87.